d in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:00:19.37,0:00:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Sniper Island's favorite son,Dialogue: 50,0:00:22.92,0:00:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,evildoers better runDialogue: 50,0:00:26.63,0:00:30.26,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,My aim is always trueDialogue: 50,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Lulu lala lu        ♪Dialogue: 50,0:00:30.34,0:00:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,~Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Turning mice eyes into bull's-eyes,Dialogue: 50,0:00:35.27,0:00:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,lock on!Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Your heart's in my sights, gotcha!Dialogue: 50,0:00:39.52,0:00:43.73,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Lock on!!Dialogue: 50,0:00:43.86,0:00:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Sniper Island's hometown hero, he'll never back downDialogue: 50,0:00:50.70,0:00:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Lululu, lulu lalaDialogue: 50,0:00:54.12,0:00:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Run away right now!Dialogue: 50,0:01:00.87,0:01:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Sogege, soge, sogeDialogue: 50,0:01:02.38,0:01:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,33,,Sogeking is here!Dialogue: 50,0:01:13.01,0:01:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Sniper Island's favorite son, ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:16.93,0:01:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ evildoers better run... ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:21.10,0:01:25.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ My aim is always true! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:25.23,0:01:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Lulu lala lu... ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.82,0:01:32.53,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Turning mice eyes into bull's-eyes, lock on! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:32.53,0:01:38.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Your heart's in my sights, gotcha! Lock on! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.54,0:01:46.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Sniper Island's hometown hero, ♪ ♪ he'll never back down! ♪Dialogue: 50,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is he doing?Dialogue: 50,0:01:31.15,0:01:33.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look at it from his perspective.Dialogue: 50,0:01:33.95,0:01:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's unable to face her as a friend,Dialogue: 50,0:01:37.04,0:01:39.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so this is his own way of settling things.Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.21,0:01:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass...Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.08,0:01:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Get over here!Dialogue: 50,0:01:46.63,0:01:47.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, alright.Dialogue: 50,0:01:53.38,0:01:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's commence Operation Rescue Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.35,0:02:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're newly acquainted. Is there anything you wish to know about me?Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.73,0:02:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First things first, you guys came from car six, so there are five cars left.Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.44,0:02:09.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, like, "Where is Sniper Island?"Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.57,0:02:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin is in one of those cars.Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.53,0:02:14.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, it's in your heart!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.16,0:02:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, are you strong?Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.91,0:02:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm super strong, jackass!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Especially this week!Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.04,0:02:26.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we manage to rescue Robin, our mission's accomplished, but...Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.08,0:02:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's a lot of enemies.Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.75,0:02:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we're careless and get surrounded in these tight quarters, we're screwed.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.92,0:02:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our best bet is to avoid the nobodies and take out their strongest fighters one by one.Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it? Listen up...Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.35,0:02:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Now I'm ready for battle!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.86,0:02:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.73,0:02:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "what's wrong"?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.32,0:02:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing changing out in the open?! You damn hussy!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.70,0:02:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– We don't mind. – We don't mind.Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.57,0:03:01.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was I supposed to do? There's only one car.Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.58,0:03:04.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cover your midriff! Put some pants on!Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.29,0:03:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, Square Sisters!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.83,0:03:09.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People like you are corrupting society!Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.46,0:03:11.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, bashful boy.Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bashful boy.Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.80,0:03:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why you...!Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.59,0:03:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.14,0:03:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the point of even making pants' pockets this small?Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't stuff meat in your pockets!Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.77,0:03:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys seem refreshed.Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.48,0:03:30.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you look to be raring to go.Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.02,0:03:31.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.23,0:03:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're doing this to save Robin!Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.23,0:03:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll knock them all out this time! Count on it!Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.40,0:03:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd better!Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.99,0:03:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you get stuck somewhere again, I'm not gonna forgive you!Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.74,0:03:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.66,0:03:45.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a reason to win now!Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A reason...Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.21,0:03:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, did you change your weapon?Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.38,0:03:51.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not exactly.Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.00,0:03:58.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After we got back from the sky island, Usopp upgraded it using dials.Dialogue: 50,0:03:58.13,0:04:00.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Perfect Climate Baton.Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.51,0:04:02.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. So it's Usopp's...Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! It's Usopp's...Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.85,0:04:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,last... work.Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.48,0:04:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit bringing the mood down!Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ready?Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.45,0:04:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, move.Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An intruder?Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.33,0:04:31.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir. That's what I heard.Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.71,0:04:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to board Puffing Tom while it's running.Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.25,0:04:37.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there really is an intruder,Dialogue: 50,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it means they snuck aboard before we departed.Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a farce.Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.01,0:04:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I agree. It's a massive blunder.Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.56,0:04:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It goes both ways, however.  They can't get off while it's running.Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.44,0:04:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the intruder and criminals must still be on the train.Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.77,0:04:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep calm and find them.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.19,0:04:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone...Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.00,0:05:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiding in a small place like this would be hard.Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.22,0:05:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Good evening! – Good evening!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.26,0:05:27.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– There they are! – There they are!Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.97,0:05:29.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're behind the door!Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.39,0:05:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've found the criminals and a suspicious man!Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.02,0:05:34.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're in car seven! Corner and capture them!Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure are lousy with a hammer.Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.94,0:05:40.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop this futile resistance!Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.95,0:05:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the door!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.24,0:05:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Board it up! Quickly!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.99,0:05:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Will do.Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marines, this way!Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suspicious men spotted in car seven!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.29,0:05:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You found them?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alert car three, as well!Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.21,0:06:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture Franky alive! There's no escape, so corner them and bring them in cautiously!Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.42,0:06:03.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stay back!Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.51,0:06:06.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! They're shooting now!Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.93,0:06:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any day now, Soge!Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.39,0:06:10.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, a little help would be nice!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.31,0:06:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot blindly!Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.81,0:06:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't kill them!Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.94,0:06:22.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone...Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step aside.Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.91,0:06:32.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I detest crooked swordplay.Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right-Angle Flash...Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.50,0:06:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bone Soir!Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.06,0:06:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Th-They're not here!Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Above us?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.24,0:07:12.62,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! The criminals are at the end of the train!Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! Hurry!Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.71,0:07:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.46,0:07:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, return to the front cars!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.92,0:07:25.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a trap!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.63,0:07:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– A trap?! – A trap?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.47,0:07:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the...?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.64,0:07:30.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go back! We've been had!Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.85,0:07:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we want to go back, the door is...Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.35,0:07:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who was that?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The cars are detached!Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.82,0:07:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.78,0:07:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! They did this!Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.19,0:07:47.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Criminal scum! You'll regret this!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.41,0:07:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it was too late...Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.20,0:07:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, gentlemen!Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.79,0:07:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Watch out for sea kings!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.29,0:07:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take care!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.92,0:08:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two cars' worth...Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.71,0:08:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's at least fifty small fries off the table.Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, Sir Sanji...Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.13,0:08:09.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't Straw Hat Luffy and the others coming along the same railway?Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.76,0:08:11.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, they'll figure something out.Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.35,0:08:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You bastards!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.68,0:08:17.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll blow you away with the door!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, going somewhere?Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.69,0:08:23.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright, shall we handle the other five cars?Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You son of a bitch!Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.45,0:08:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't think you can get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.37,0:08:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you?! Even Captain T-Bone...?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.41,0:08:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Report this to CP9!Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.58,0:08:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are still some lackeys?Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.17,0:08:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Frites...Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.67,0:08:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Assorties!Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.05,0:08:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sogeking...Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.68,0:08:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gunpowder Star!Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.93,0:08:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Right!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire the heavyweight bullets!Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.65,0:09:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They hit him!Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.91,0:09:16.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow.Dialogue: 50,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.75,0:09:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How come the gun isn't working?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.60,0:09:44.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey! What the hell are you?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.73,0:09:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm a cyborg.Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.57,0:09:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A cyborg?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep.Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.11,0:09:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steel and weapons are built into my body.Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.28,0:09:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm shot, it hurts a bit, and I might bleed,Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.66,0:09:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but that's about it.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something like that is possible?Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world is a big place, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.17,0:10:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So if I...Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.09,0:10:09.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch!Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.05,0:10:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you jerk?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.51,0:10:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? You felt that tiny needle?Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You butthead!Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.43,0:10:17.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do I look like your science experiment?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.81,0:10:20.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, listen up! My back is different!Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.56,0:10:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see,Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.31,0:10:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because I did the modifications myself, I couldn't reach my back.Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only my front is cybernetic.Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.61,0:10:31.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y'know, while I'm at it, I'll tell you one more thing.Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.53,0:10:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My belly tends to get chilly. Any clue why?Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.45,0:10:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How would I know?Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.28,0:10:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because I've got a fridge in my stomach to chill cola.Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.62,0:10:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's handy!Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing! That'd be great on a scorcher!Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, this isn't the time for small talk!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.46,0:10:48.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We beat all the enemies in this car!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.38,0:10:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's clear, so let's move on!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next up, car four.Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.69,0:11:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze!Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.94,0:11:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm mad, mad Wanze!Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.28,0:11:13.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.11,0:11:14.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze!Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.78,0:11:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, fellas!Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.24,0:11:23.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze.Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the head steward, so I can cook anything!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.83,0:11:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Want some ramen? Okay, I'll make ramen.Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.34,0:11:32.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But first, I wanna share a juicy tidbit with you.Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.09,0:11:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My nose hairs look like this!Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.84,0:11:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They reticulate, crisscrossing like fishnet pantyhose.Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind!Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.85,0:11:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then! First, I'll put the flour in my mouth and knead it well.Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.03,0:11:57.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, bon appétit!Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.91,0:11:59.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Who'd eat that?! – Who'd eat that?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.16,0:12:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that was a waste of time.Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.45,0:12:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanze, we're keeping someone waiting.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.04,0:12:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry. So, see ya.Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.54,0:12:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to pass through this car,Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you'll have to go through me!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to stop us?Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.81,0:12:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will stop you! Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.72,0:12:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm on this escort mission!Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.14,0:12:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the event of an attack like this, I'm here to handle it!Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.23,0:12:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want to free the criminal, you'll have to best my ramen kenpo!Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,R-Ramen kenpo?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"R-Ramen kenpo?!"Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That son of a bitch! He's mocking me!Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.54,0:12:50.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your cool, moron! That's what he wants!Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.17,0:12:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now! How was my impersonation of that idiot?Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.17,0:12:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, keep calm!Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.92,0:12:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.05,0:13:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This guy needs a chill pill.Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! The bullets grazed him,Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.06,0:13:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he still looks unfazed. Carefree, even...Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.60,0:13:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I thought my heart was gonna jump out of my chest!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were shocked?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.11,0:13:18.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Control your expressions, will you?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– I'll handle this pain in the ass! – I'll handle this pain in the ass!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.82,0:13:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you guys.Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.49,0:13:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he can push your buttons that easily, we'll be here all night.Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.91,0:13:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make short work of him.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.25,0:13:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What really irks me is someone like you calling themselves a cook.Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.22,0:13:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to you!Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hey! He got to you, too! – Hey! He got to you, too!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.06,0:13:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But look!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He dodged Sanji's kick easily!Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.98,0:13:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with his carefree expression?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.48,0:13:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.11,0:13:57.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you were shocked?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.48,0:13:59.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm over this gag!Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.58,0:14:07.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway...Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.62,0:14:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,leave this guy to me.Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys go to the next car.Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.55,0:14:23.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rear two cars were detached?Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you people doing back there?Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We apologize profusely.Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.01,0:14:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of our heavy hitters, Captain T-Bone, was in the detached cars as well.Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.56,0:14:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, bring me up to speed on the situation.Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.77,0:14:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.73,0:14:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are five cars remaining, excluding the locomotive.Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.65,0:14:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, every soldier in car five has been wiped out.Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.15,0:14:46.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that only leaves Agent Wanze in car four,Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agent Nero in car three,Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.28,0:14:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin in car one,Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.25,0:14:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and everyone here in car two!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.37,0:14:58.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would seem our enemy is no fool.Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.71,0:15:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, if there is a problem here for us,Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it's only the fact that Franky is loose.Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.09,0:15:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our mission is to bring Franky and Nico Robin to Enies Lobby, nothing more.Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.97,0:15:15.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides that, regardless of how the other enemies die,Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or if our own allies should fall,Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.56,0:15:19.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it won't interfere with our mission.Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.94,0:15:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, did you catch a glimpse of the enemy?Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.78,0:15:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am! First, there were the two that were in custody,Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.95,0:15:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,although one of them was wearing a bizarre mask.Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.95,0:15:33.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There was also a dapper blond we've never seen before!Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, a total of three!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.58,0:15:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like the long-nosed man, that man is probably one of the Straw Hats.Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.67,0:15:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, his purpose is to recover Nico Robin.Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like Franky is assisting them.Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.84,0:15:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, shall I go stand watch over Nico Robin?Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary.Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.52,0:15:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Focus on recapturing Franky.Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can try as they might to rescue Nico Robin...Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but in the end, their efforts...Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.86,0:16:07.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will all be for naught.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.61,0:16:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... won't... let... you... pass... through!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll knead alloy flour and...!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna bring out ramen again?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.29,0:16:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen...Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.75,0:16:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beam...!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are sharp!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.30,0:16:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beam!Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.22,0:16:27.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beam!Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.88,0:16:28.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beam!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.35,0:16:32.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yikes!Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.10,0:16:36.77,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Oopsie!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.61,0:16:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go up and around!Dialogue: 50,0:16:42.77,0:16:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.90,0:16:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Well then, Sir Sanji! Best of luck to you!Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.15,0:16:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got away so easily!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.58,0:16:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't matter!Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.74,0:17:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero is waiting for them in the next car!Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.21,0:17:05.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He may be the newbie, but he's an agent of CP9, a group of assassins for justice! They're toast!Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.34,0:17:10.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero loves to kill! Now, now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flanchet...Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.06,0:17:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I need to say it? I'm in a hurry.Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, take this!Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.40,0:17:24.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo: Noodle Slicer!Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire...Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.28,0:17:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Skate!Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.38,0:17:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...!Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.13,0:17:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He dodged while also kicking me, like, ten times!Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.47,0:17:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twelve times, actually.Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.93,0:17:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it possible... that you're super strong?Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just not as strong as you think.Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.14,0:18:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.19,0:18:05.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even my old man talks to me like that!Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.31,0:18:06.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quit being so rude!Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm Wanze!Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.36,0:18:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what? You're actually pretty good!Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.24,0:18:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I am getting dizzy looking at your weird eyebrows.Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.49,0:18:22.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're one to talk about someone's face being weird!Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.58,0:18:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.09,0:18:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you why I was chosen for the criminal escort team!Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo Secret Technique...Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.73,0:18:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat the noodles!  Beat the noodles, and they're done!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.32,0:18:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha...?Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.16,0:19:00.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The edible combat suit of your dreams!Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.75,0:19:07.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ra-Men's Formal Suit!Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.71,0:19:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, now, now!Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.42,0:19:14.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real trick to ramen kenpo is controlling the noodles at will!Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.93,0:19:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard...Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you keep playing with food?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.89,0:19:23.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speed, power, and special abilities...Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.60,0:19:26.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in all those areas,  I'm on a whole other level now!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.44,0:19:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you incomparable strength!Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.78,0:19:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough talk. Bring it.Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.62,0:19:43.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you're hungry, because I'm gonna make you eat every last one of those damn noodles.Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.33,0:19:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who the hell are you?Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.55,0:19:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,Waiting atop car three is CP9's newbie,Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.43,0:20:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,20,,a Four Powers master,Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nero the Sea Weasel.Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.98,0:20:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what a shame, you're someone I can't kill...Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.19,0:20:14.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since you're one of our important criminals.Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.78,0:20:16.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy!Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you out on the roof?Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you had just waited, I would've come to you.Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.45,0:20:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that wasn't a certainty, right?Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.62,0:20:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might've cheated and skipped this car, right?Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're pretty vigilant!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.84,0:20:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But being on guard is important, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, what's that behind you?Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.31,0:20:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was scummy!Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.57,0:20:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah it was!Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.23,0:20:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back home, I'm the king of the scum.Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.03,0:21:05.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Octoshoes...Dialogue: 50,0:21:05.99,0:21:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Octoshoes...Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.43,0:21:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long Nose!Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.85,0:21:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ Sniper–Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:02.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.10,0:00:02.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:02.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.14,0:00:02.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:02.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.19,0:00:02.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:02.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.23,0:00:02.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.27,0:00:02.31,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.27,0:00:02.31,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.31,0:00:02.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.31,0:00:02.35,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:02.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.35,0:00:02.39,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:02.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.39,0:00:02.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:02.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.44,0:00:02.48,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:02.52,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.48,0:00:02.52,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:02.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.52,0:00:02.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.56,0:00:02.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.56,0:00:02.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.60,0:00:02.64,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,*,SniperDialogue: 1,0:00:02.60,0:00:02.64,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,*,SniperDialogue: 0,0:00:02.64,0:00:02.69,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,SniperDialogue: 1